[00:01.00] 指挥家 : Richard Davis
[00:02.00] 作词 : Eliza Shaddad/Grace Chatto/Jack Patterson/Neil Amin-Smith
[00:08.25]I was a fool for you
[00:08.25]我曾为你痴狂
[00:16.98]And I went all round town
[00:16.98]寻遍整座城巷
[00:27.69]When I finally saw you
[00:27.69]当终于遇见你时
[00:37.08]Might, might I'll speak again to make clear sound
[00:37.08]或许 或许该再次开口让心意澄明
[00:46.31]like cold
[00:46.31]如寒冰
[00:51.28]Cold Cold Cold Cold
[00:51.28]冷冽 刺骨 凛冽 彻骨
[01:12.17]Cold Cold
[01:12.17]冰冷 刺骨
[01:23.67]It's not enough to hear you
[01:23.67]仅闻其声不足够
[01:30.51]Your, your voice will never do
[01:30.51]你 你的嗓音永难将息
[01:42.78]I find I hate to be near you
[01:42.78]我发觉厌恶与你相近
[01:50.95]I, I long to see this evening through
[01:50.95]我 我渴望熬过这漫长夜晚
[02:02.56]eyes cold
[02:02.56]目光如霜
[02:07.44]Cold Cold Cold Cold
[02:07.44]冷冽 刺骨 凛冽 彻骨
